peating the same experiment for 10 trials and computing
the standard deviation of the results. We observe that
LRE results are subject to higher statistical uncertainty.
This is expected from the overhead analysis presented in
Section IID and from Figure 3: the error mitigation cost
c of LRE increases with the number of layers (or circuit
